---
layout: base.njk
ogType: article
---
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": {{ title | dump | safe }},
  "description": {{ (description or "") | dump | safe }},
  "datePublished": "{{ page.date | dateISO }}",
  "dateModified": "{{ (updated or page.date) | dateISO }}",
  "image": "{{ site.url }}{{ cover or site.ogImage }}",
  "mainEntityOfPage": "{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}",
  "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": {{ site.author | dump | safe }} },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": {{ site.title | dump | safe }},
    "telephone": {{ site.phone | dump | safe }}
  },
  "articleSection": {{ (categoryLabel or "") | dump | safe }}
}
</script>

<article class="post">
  <header class="post-head">
    {% if categoryLabel %}
      <a class="post-cat" href="/blog/category/{{ category }}/">{{ categoryLabel }}</a>
    {% endif %}
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    {% if description %}<p class="post-sum">{{ description }}</p>{% endif %}
    <p class="post-meta">
      <time datetime="{{ page.date | dateISO }}">{{ page.date | dateKR }}</time>
      {% if updated %} · <span>{{ updated | dateKR }} 수정</span>{% endif %}
    </p>
  </header>

  {% if cover %}
    <img class="post-cover" src="{{ cover }}" alt="{{ coverAlt or title }}">
  {% endif %}

  <div class="post-body">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>

  <aside class="post-cta">
    <h2>우리 공간에도 놓을 수 있을까요?</h2>
    <p>설치 장소 사진 한 장만 있어도 상담이 훨씬 빨라져요.</p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">전화 걸기 {{ site.phone }}</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/#contact">문의 남기기</a>
    </p>
  </aside>

  {% set related = [] %}
  {% for p in collections.blogPosts %}
    {% if p.url != page.url and p.data.category == category and related.length < 3 %}
      {% set related = (related.push(p), related) %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% if related.length %}
  <section class="post-related">
    <h2>이어서 읽기</h2>
    <ul class="post-list">
      {% for p in related %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ p.url }}">
          <span class="post-cat">{{ p.data.categoryLabel }}</span>
          <strong>{{ p.data.title }}</strong>
          <time datetime="{{ p.date | dateISO }}">{{ p.date | dateKR }}</time>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {% endif %}
</article>
